flowchart LR
    Client[HTTP client + idempotency key] --> Transfer[TransferService]
    subgraph Financial[PostgreSQL transaction A · financial authority]
        Transfer --> Key[Durable request/result]
        Transfer --> Ledger[Balances + paired immutable ledger]
        Ledger --> Outbox[One immutable outbox event]
    end
    Outbox --> Relay[Bounded relay · lease + generation fence]
    Relay --> Kafka[Kafka · at-least-once transport]
    Kafka --> Consumer[Event consumer]
    subgraph Effect[PostgreSQL transaction B · activity effect]
        Consumer --> Inbox[Inbox identity]
        Inbox --> Activity[One transfer projection + two activity rows]
        Consumer --> Quarantine[Durable quarantine + audited replay]
    end
    Activity --> Offset[Offset acknowledgement after durable commit]
    Quarantine --> Offset
    Offset -.-> Kafka
    Note[One PostgreSQL database; activity is never balance authority]
